-- Daily prize wall check (Nov 25 2026, second run): Regional Qualifier prize walls for Sydney, Vancouver, Utrecht
-- and Hartford (uvsgames.com/rq-*-prize-wall) and the RC Europe prize wall (riftboundop.com/rceu-prize-wall).
-- Makes sure those 4 events are on the Origins, Spiritforged and Unleashed Plated Legends, the 4 double-sized
-- battlefields and the Regional Rune Collection (Vancouver and Hartford only), and adds the 2 Player Poro Playmat.
-- Rows that already list the event are left alone. Safe to run more than once.

